{
  "_comment": [
    "Golden set for `manamap eval-embeddings`. Each group is a set of cards a player would",
    "call functionally interchangeable; a good embedding puts them near each other.",
    "",
    "HAND-AUTHORED ON PURPOSE. This file must never be derived from mechanical tags, card",
    "roles, the synergy graph or combo data — the training objective mines positives from",
    "those, so deriving the eval from them would measure whether training memorised its own",
    "supervision. Independence is the only thing that makes these numbers mean anything.",
    "",
    "split: 'dev' groups were used while diagnosing the collapse, so any choice made in",
    "response to those numbers is fitted to them. 'test' groups were written afterwards and",
    "touched nothing. Report both; believe the test split."
